"# Design System Health Report

16 components · 514 tokens · scan: 0 errors · 43 warnings · 19 hints

## Deviations by owner — who fixes what

| Owner | Count | Action |
| --- | --- | --- |
| 🎨 Figma-Fix | 36 | Add or align tokens in Figma |
| 🛠 Data-Quality | 2 | Fix the source value or name |
| 🔧 Manual-Dev | 18 | Hand-code in the Nuxt app |
| 🔁 Heuristic | 3 | Reroutable in the inspector |
| ⊘ by-design | 3 | Inherent Nuxt UI constraint — nothing to do |
| Other | 0 | Un-owned |

## Component completeness

| Component | Status |
| --- | --- |
| badge | ⚠ size md 4/5 (missing padding-y) |
| button | ⚠ size xs 2/4 (missing padding-x, icon-size); ⚠ size md 3/4 (missing gap); ⚠ size lg 2/4 (missing gap, icon-size) |
| card | ✓ complete |
| checkbox | ⚠ size sm 1/2 (missing icon-size) |
| chip | ✓ complete |
| dropdown | ✓ complete |
| input | ✓ complete |
| kbd | ✓ complete |
| modal | ✓ complete |
| nav | ✓ complete |
| progress | ✓ complete |
| radio | ✓ complete |
| switch | ⚠ size sm 2/3 (missing size) |
| table | ✓ complete |
| textarea | ✓ complete |
| typography | ✓ complete |

## Designer action items (🎨 Figma-Fix + 🛠 Data-Quality)

### Typos & naming (2)

- [ ] \`spaching\` looks like a typo of \`spacing\` — did you mean \`badge-letter-spacing\`? (1 token)
- [ ] \`heigth\` looks like a typo of \`height\` — did you mean \`typography-heading-2-line-height\`? (1 token)

### Variant coverage gaps (7)

- [ ] button.bg-active is defined on [ghost, outline, solid] but missing on [link]. Add \`button-link-bg-active\` in Figma if the gap is unintentional.
- [ ] button.bg-disabled is defined on [ghost, outline, solid] but missing on [link]. Add \`button-link-bg-disabled\` in Figma if the gap is unintentional.
- [ ] button.ring-focus is defined on [ghost, outline, solid] but missing on [link]. Add \`button-link-ring-focus\` in Figma if the gap is unintentional.
- [ ] button.border-hover is defined on [outline] but missing on [ghost, link, solid]. Only one variant defines this — likely intentional (e.g. outline is the only variant with a border), but worth confirming. Add \`button-ghost-border-hover\`, \`button-link-border-hover\`, \`button-solid-border-hover\` in Figma if the gap is unintentional.
- [ ] button.border-disabled is defined on [outline] but missing on [ghost, link, solid]. Only one variant defines this — likely intentional (e.g. outline is the only variant with a border), but worth confirming. Add \`button-ghost-border-disabled\`, \`button-link-border-disabled\`, \`button-solid-border-disabled\` in Figma if the gap is unintentional.
- [ ] button.text-active is defined on [ghost] but missing on [link, outline, solid]. Only one variant defines this — likely intentional (e.g. outline is the only variant with a border), but worth confirming. Add \`button-link-text-active\`, \`button-outline-text-active\`, \`button-solid-text-active\` in Figma if the gap is unintentional.
- [ ] button.text-hover is defined on [ghost, link] but missing on [outline, solid]. Add \`button-outline-text-hover\`, \`button-solid-text-hover\` in Figma if the gap is unintentional.

### Size scale gaps (20)

- [ ] button.padding-x (6px) conflicts with button.padding-x-md (8px). Size-specific value wins.
- [ ] button.gap (4px) conflicts with button.gap-xs (2px). Size-specific value wins.
- [ ] button.xs is missing: padding-x, icon-size
- [ ] button.md is missing: gap
- [ ] button.lg is missing: gap, icon-size
- [ ] button.gap has sizes [xs, sm] but other utilities also cover [md, lg].
- [ ] button.padding-x has sizes [sm, md, lg] but other utilities also cover [xs].
- [ ] button.icon-size has sizes [sm, md] but other utilities also cover [xs, lg].
- [ ] button: size 'xs' appears on fewer utilities than its siblings — possibly typo or unfinished pass.
- [ ] button: size 'md' appears on fewer utilities than its siblings — possibly typo or unfinished pass.
- [ ] button: size 'lg' appears on fewer utilities than its siblings — possibly typo or unfinished pass.
- [ ] badge.md is missing: padding-y
- [ ] badge.padding-y has sizes [sm] but other utilities also cover [md].
- [ ] badge: size 'md' appears on fewer utilities than its siblings — possibly typo or unfinished pass.
- [ ] checkbox.sm is missing: icon-size
