- [ ] checkbox: size 'sm' appears on fewer utilities than its siblings — possibly typo or unfinished pass.
- [ ] switch.sm is missing: size
- [ ] switch.size has sizes [md] but other utilities also cover [sm].
- [ ] switch: size 'sm' appears on fewer utilities than its siblings — possibly typo or unfinished pass.

### Mode-invariant colors (7)

- [ ] color-text-on-accent has identical light + dark values — consider moving to a primitive file.
- [ ] color-action-bg has identical light + dark values — consider moving to a primitive file.
- [ ] color-action-text has identical light + dark values — consider moving to a primitive file.
