### Snap to the Tailwind scale (2)

- [ ] font-size-text-xs = 10px is close to text-xs (12px) — consider snapping.
- [ ] font-size-text-3xl = 32px is close to text-3xl (30px) — consider snapping.

## Output targets

| Target | Output | Coverage |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Nuxt UI | \`nuxt/app.config.ts\` + runnable \`kit/\` | 16 components |
| shadcn/ui | \`shadcn/globals.css\` | 19 theme vars + sidebar (mirrors the main palette); a \`--chart-*\` palette is a manual choice |
| Generic | \`tokens/\` (\`variables.css\`, \`tokens.json\`, \`tokens.ts\`) | 196 design tokens (44 with dark-mode) |

## Output forecast

~7.2 KB tokens.css · 52 Tailwind matches · 100 theme extensions · 44 mode-variant entries
"
